-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",243,{
[7745]="7001AD3B\n1\tObserve the race to see if Lar is victorious\tThe Keg-Hopping Race begins soon on this very track. You think that Lar will win the race, and you should observe whether or not this comes to pass.\n2\tTalk to Arnar\tArnar can be found in the Keg-race area during the Summer Festival. You should speak with Arnar and collect the bountiful prize he has to offer for your excellent luck.\n",
[7746]="7001B5EB\n1\tTalk to Jorfi\tSpeak with Jorfi to receive two free tickets to the Keg-hopping Races.\n",
[7747]="7001AD3D\n1\tObserve the race to see if Ottó is victorious\tThe Keg-hopping Race begins soon on this very track. You have guessed that Ottó will win the race, and you should observe whether or not this comes to pass.\n2\tTalk to Arnar\tArnar can be found in the Keg-race area during the Summer Festival. You should speak with Arnar and collect the bountiful prize he has to offer for your excellent luck.\n",
[7748]="7001AD3C\n1\tObserve the race to see if Signar is victorious\tThe Keg-Hopping Race begins soon on this very track. You have guessed that Signar will win the race, and you should observe whether or not this comes to pass.\n2\tTalk to Arnar\tArnar can be found in the Keg-race area during the Summer Festival. You should speak with Arnar and collect the bountiful prize he has to offer for your excellent luck.\n",
[7749]="7003A4CA\n1\tRescue captive Rohirrim in Gurz-shâpol\tYou have come across captive Rohirrim that have been tortured and caged in Gurz-shâpol. You should rescue them from their captors.\n2\tCaptured Rohirrim can be found throughout Gurz-shâpol. You have come across captive Rohirrim that have been tortured and caged in Gurz-shâpol. You should rescue them from their captors.\t\n3\tCompleted\tYou have rescued all of the Rohirrim in Gurz-shâpol, sparing them a horrific fate.\n",
[7750]="7007162D\n1\tDefeat kergrim at the Tombs of Khâb Ishil (total: 12)\030Defeat Lamâmut, the Corpse-chewer\tTombs of Khâb Ishil have been overrun with kergrim and need to be cleared out. You should defeat the kergrim and their leader, Lamâmut, the Corpse-chewer, at the Tombs of Khâb Ishil.\n2\tTalk to Malêrti\tYou have cleared the kergrim from the Tombs of Khâb Ishil. You should return to Malêrti at the Dawn-warden.\n",
[7751]="7002672B\n1\tDefeat kergrim in Haudh Valandur (total: 4)\tHaudh Valandur is within the Way of Kings, west of the Ranger-camp. Maladan asked you to go to Haudh Valandur and defeat the kergrim found within.\n2\tTalk to Maladan in the Way of Kings\tMaladan is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Maladan will be pleased to hear that you survived the kergrim of Haudh Valandur.\n",
[7752]="7006C50A\n1\tDefeat kergrim (total: 8)\030Ransacked supplies gathered (total: 8)\tYour mission is to travel to Tûkurdul and recover supplies that got ransacked and save the driver if you can. Of course you should slay any kergrim you see in the area for good measure.\n",
[7753]="70017522\n1\tDefeat Bonetooth\030Defeat Old Gnawer\tBonetooth and Old Gnawer are within Skûmfil, south-east of the Shadowed Refuge. Odmar wants you to put an end to the kergrim-leaders who brought the corpse-eating creatures through the tunnels of Moria to Skûmfil.\n2\tTalk to Odmar at the Shadowed Refuge\tOdmar is at the Shadowed Refuge, north-west of Skûmfil. You found the two kergrim, one ancient and the other a summoner, and destroyed them both. Odmar, at the Shadowed Refuge will be pleased to know that this is done.\n",
[7754]="7006A9DB\n1\tTalk to Keteph\tMake your way to the Swain's Guild-hall in Umbar Baharbêl and speak with Keteph. He requires assistance and thinks you are the person for the job.\n",
[7755]="700266E4\n1\tCollect keys within the Way of Kings (total: 4)\t\n2\tBring the keys to Maladan\tMaladan is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Maladan will want to examine the keys you collected.\n",
[7756]="7004BEB4\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's loyal (total: 4)\tKhirgi's loyal can be found in Fushaum Bal North. You should defeat Khirgi's loyal while avoiding the guards. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[7757]="7004BEB6\n1\tDefeat Khirgi's Scouts (total: 4)\tKhirgi's Scouts can be found around Fushaum Bal. You should defeat any men scouting around Fushaum Bal.\n2\tTalk to Mâlatuk\tMâlatuk can be found at Fushaum Bal. You should talk to Mâlatuk.\n",
[7758]="7000E8B9\n1\tDefeat Khlârum\tKhlârum lurks near the camp of Akûltot in the eastern Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs. Handarod has asked you to aid the Elves of Rivendell by defeating the goblin Khlârum.\n2\tTalk to Handarod\tHandarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains. You should return to Handarod and tell him of Khlârum's defeat.\n",
[7759]="7005A953\n1\tLight fires to scare off cave-beasts at Khorroz\tKhorroz can be found in Máttugard. You should light fires to scare off some of the cave-beasts at Khorroz.\n2\tSet fire to a large pile at Khorroz\tKhorroz can be found in Máttugard. You should light fires to scare off some of the cave-beasts at Khorroz.\n3\tBurn piles of refuse at Khorroz (total: 8)\030Pick up a torch to burn other piles of refuse\tKhorroz can be found in Máttugard. You should light fires to scare off some of the cave-beasts at Khorroz. Note: Torches can be dropped by right clicking the induction bar.\n4\tCompleted\tBurned piles of refuse to scare off cave-beasts at Khorroz.\n",
[7760]="7005A957\n1\tCollect dwarf trinkets (total: 12)\tKhorroz can be found in Máttugard. You should collect dwarf trinkets at Khorroz.\n2\tPlace the dwarf trinkets in a supply chest\tA supply chest can be found at any dwarf outpost in Máttugard. You should place the dwarf trinkets in a supply chest.\n",
[7761]="70068BDD\n1\tAttend Khâshap's assembly\tKhâshap plans to confront the rumours head on by appearing before the Gut. Hadorion believes we should spring the trap now.\n2\tConfront Khâshap\tKhâshap has gathered his Corsairs and makes his escape into the back alleys of the Lower Ward. He must be stopped here before he delivers the phials of Ifrinn to his master.\n3\tTalk to Hadorion\tKhâshap has fled into the back streets of the Gut. Hadorion believes this is the final chance. Khâshap is cornered.\n",
[7762]="7006C588\n1\tTalk to Numûru\tAmalíbi suggests you cross the Bridge of Danagír and seek Numûru. Numûru is the first lieutenant of a rising force who is rumoured among the Shagâna to be a warrior-queen of old reborn.\n",
[7763]="700700C6\n1\tGet a pair of Claw Kickin' Boots from the crate\tMaginard wants you to kick any thieving cave-claws you find inside the tunnel under Staddle. To do so safely, you must have a sturdy pair of kicking boots. Maginard told you of a nearby crate of such boots in the Staddle village centre.\n2\tKick thieving cave-claws (total: 6)\tMaginard wants you to kick any cave-claws you find inside the tunnel to the south-east of the Staddle village centre. Use your Claw Kickin' Boots to send the beasts flying.\n",
[7764]="7002C004\n1\tDefeat Gozug\tGozug can be found deep within the troll-infested Stone-hole, north of Gnarlstump's camp. Gnarlstump has asked you to defeat Gozug, chieftain of the wild trolls of the Brown Lands.\n2\tTalk to Gnarlstump in the Brown Lands\tGnarlstump is at his camp, south of the Stone-hole. You should return to Gnarlstump with news of your victory.\n",
[7765]="7005299F\n1\tDestroy shunned swords (total: 10)\tWeapons taken from the Gladden Fields into Kidzul-kâlah should be destroyed before they can be used for some foul purpose.\n",
[7766]="7005299B\n1\tDefeat the Bonds of the Drowned\tSome creature stirs the shades of Kidzul-kâlah to wakefulness, and it must be defeated.\n",
[7767]="700529A9\n1\tDefeat Kidzul darkwaters (total: 12)\030Defeat shadow-grims (total: 6)\tDarkwaters menace the drowned ruins of Kidzul-kâlah, and must be defeated.\n",
[7768]="700529A1\n1\tCollect brooches of the fallen (total: 8)\tBrooches of the fallen have been taken to Kidzul-kâlah, and should be reclaimed from those who deserve them not.\n",
[7769]="7006C128\n1\tSet ablaze scorpion burrows (total: 8)\030Defeat scorpions (total: 14)\tDefeat scorpions and destroy their burrows to cull their number.\n2\tDefeat Tamâhu, the dread-scorpion\030Find the dread-scorpion Tamâhu\tFind and defeat Tamâhu, the dread-scorpion.\n",
[7770]="70027B07\n1\tDefeat rats in the barracks (total: 10)\tThe entrance to the barracks is located in the south-east wall of the main cavern beneath Isengard. Your Uruk-hai overseer wants you to kill the rats that have taken over the barracks.\n2\tTalk to your Uruk-hai overseer\tYou should talk to your Uruk-hai overseer now that you have defeated many rats in the barracks.\n",
[7771]="70016754\n1\tBurn the fungal structures (total: 4)\tThe fungal structures can be found in and near Dalgum-ru, south of the Shadowed Refuge. Tyki wants you to burn some of the strange fungal structures close to the Orcs' camp.\n2\tSpeak to Tyki at the Shadowed Refuge\tTyki is at the Shadowed Refuge, north of Dalgum-ru. You should return to Tyki to tell him how flammable those fungal structures turned out to be.\n",
[7772]="7001E990\n1\tCollect sealed orders (total: 5)\tSealed orders may be found on the Orcs at Gâthlata, east of Mithechad, north of Ânghum-maudhûl. Eirien has asked you to collect sealed orders from the Orcs of Gâthlata.\n2\tTalk to Eirien at Mithechad\tEirien is at Mithechad, west of Gâthlata. You should bring the sealed orders you discovered to Eirien at once.\n",
[7773]="7001A4A6\n1\tDefeat Âthruk at Maudhul-ulur\tÂthruk can be found at Maudhul-ulur, south from Echad Glamodúd. Goldínwen has asked you to defeat Âthruk, the overseer of Maudhul-ulur.\n2\tTalk to Goldínwen at Echad Glamodúd\tGoldínwen is at Echad Glamodúd, north from Maudhul-ulur. You should return to Goldínwen with news of your victory.\n",
[7774]="7005887D\n1\tDestroy black powder crates in Dûn Traikh (total: 12)\tDûn Traikh is in western Elderslade. You should destroy the black powder crates in Dûn Traikh.\n2\tTalk to Gunvald\tGunvald is in Annâk-khurfu, in eastern Elderslade. You should talk to Gunvald.\n",
[7775]="70052B24\n1\tDefeat Taurogrim and burn their remains (total: 10)\tTaurogrim can be found throughout Tríubad in Woodsedge. Believing it might cleanse the Vales of Anduin of their evil, Clothar has asked you to burn the remains of fallen Taurogrim at Tríubad.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have burned the remains of many of the Taurogrim at Tríubad.\n",
[7776]="7003045E\n1\tTalk to the old man again...\tThe old man in rags is near the White Hand Encampment in north-east Fangorn. The old man in rags wishes to speak with you again.\n2\tAgree with the old man\tThe old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn. You should agree with the old man, since what he says is so reasonable. You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.\n3\tTalk to the old man again\tThe old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn. The old man in rags wishes to speak with you again.\n4\tBreak the old man's spell! Say no to him, if you can\tThe old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn. You should say no to the old man and break the strange spell he has over you. You must select the intended target and perform an emote to advance this quest.\n5\tTalk to the old man again, now that the veil is lifted\030Defeat the warrior summoned by Saruman\tThe old man in rags is near the White Hand encampment in north-east Fangorn. You should speak with the old man in rags once more.\n6\tTalk to Wisewood\tWisewood is at his place near the White Hand encampment in north-eastern Fangorn. You should speak with Wisewood.\n",
})
